        "markdown": "## Discussion Map\n\nFollow the semantic edges to examine the boundary: the problem motivates the idea, the proposed approach advances it, evidence supports the assumption, the alternative questions the approach, the risk threatens the idea, and the next step tests whether directory membership truly works without editing the collection root."
